>>> eval an ASYNC expression — it must be awaited, not returned pending

  expression polls in-page for up to 5s, then resolves the product list

>>> run: shaka-perf troubleshoot eval perf:experiment (async () => {
  const read = () => Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('a[href^="/products/"] h2'), (el) => el.textContent.trim());
  const deadline = Date.now() + 5000;
  while (read().length === 0 && Date.now() < deadline) await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 100));
  return read();
})()

